  "captured_at": "2026-11-04",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Downloading the Zscaler Authentication Bridge (ZAB) virtual machine (VM) is one of the tasks you must complete when deploying a ZAB. For a complete list of tasks, see Deploying a Zscaler Authentication Bridge."
    },
    {
      "text": "To download the ZAB VM:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Administration > Internet & SaaS Authentication > Internet Authentication Settings.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          46
        ],
        [
          49,
          79
        ],
        [
          82,
          114
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the Authentication Bridges tab.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          11,
          33
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Authentication Bridges tab, click Download ZAB VM.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          29
        ],
        [
          41,
          56
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Download ZAB VM window appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Download ZAB VM window, enter a Number of Users, which the Zscaler service uses to provide recommended specifications for the ZAB VM, and click Compute.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          22
        ],
        [
          39,
          55
        ],
        [
          151,
          158
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Recommended VM Specs section appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          24
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Recommended VM Specs section, review the VM specs and click Download ZAB VM to download the ZAB VM.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          27
        ],
        [
          67,
          82
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Close.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          11
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}
